  "format": 1,
  "title": {
    "zh": "skyrocks 的 DSH 插件",
    "en": "skyrocks DSH plugins"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "输入框下方的余额、花费与套餐额度，模型列表里的 GO 月度额度，让模型自己查 / 切模型的工具，给会话列表补上真正的删除（回收站 + 撤销），每一轮对话结束时的耗时明细，设置里的多数据源数据库查询（默认只读、写入逐条审批），以及按日 / 周 / 月统计所有会话的 token 消耗。",
    "en": "Composer-docked balance, spend and quota readouts, monthly limits in the model picker, model-callable switching tools, real session deletion with a trash and undo, a per-turn timing readout under every reply, multi-source database queries managed in Settings (read-only by default), and day / week / month token usage across every session."
  },
