    {
      "name": "@skyrocks/dsh-turn-timing",
      "title": {
        "zh": "每轮耗时明细",
        "en": "Per-turn timing"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "每一轮对话结束，在末尾直接显示时间花在哪：模型 / 编码 / 构建 / 测试 / 清理。点开看小分类（等首字、思考、识图、看文件、编辑、git、脚本…），识图不会被算成 0.06 秒的工具调用。零 token、不写日志。",
        "en": "After every turn, shows where the time went: model / coding / build / test / cleanup. Expand for sub-categories (first token, thinking, vision, viewing, editing, git, scripts…); vision is attributed to the model call that reads the screenshot. Zero tokens, no logging."
