    {
      "name": "@skyrocks/dsh-db",
      "title": {
        "zh": "数据库查询",
        "en": "Database queries"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "多数据源数据库查询：在设置里添加 / 编辑 / 删除数据源，可以就地测试连接；模型通过工具直接查。默认只读（语句白名单 + 数据库会话只读），写入逐条审批。支持海量 Vastbase / openGauss、达梦 DM8、PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLite。",
        "en": "Multi-source database queries: add, edit, and remove data sources in Settings and test them in place; the model queries them through tools. Read-only by default (statement gate + session-level read-only), every write needs approval. Vastbase / openGauss, Dameng DM8, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite."
      },
