    {
      "name": "@skyrocks/dsh-token-stats",
      "title": {
        "zh": "Token 用量",
        "en": "Token usage"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "在设置里按日 / 周 / 月统计所有会话（含子代理）的 token 消耗：今日 / 本周 / 本月三张卡，输入 / 缓存读写 / 输出堆叠柱状图，模型分布与会话排行。只读本地会话日志，首次打开后台回填历史并显示进度，账本存在 ~/.dsh/token-stats/usage.json。",
        "en": "Day / week / month token usage for every session, subagents included, under Settings: Today / This week / This month cards, stacked input / cache / output bars, a per-model split, and a per-session ranking. It only reads local session logs, backfills history in the background on first open, and stores the ledger at ~/.dsh/token-stats/usage.json."
      },
